      "message": "As network adapter is a generic broad term for any hardware that connects to the network and work as an umbrella category which as stated can include Ethernet NICs, converged network adapters etc.\nShould there be a property under this interface to hold enumerations of such type to identify the actual hardware component being referred to?\nWithout which all adapters looks identical in inventory.",
